{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.279958711303858, "source": "諸侯", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.027173113134079, "source": "諸侯", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.614959778036198, "source": "諸侯", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.209494669928034, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.7691330875378674, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.148622709242771, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.7691330875378674, "source": "失", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.1878434223960523, "source": "失", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.1041341542702074, "source": "失", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.951454644331822, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0055218656020977, "source": "天下", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.6854238194120224, "source": "居", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.9367156180185177, "source": "居", "target": "安"}, {"weight": 1.6854238194120224, "source": "安", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8744936031956937, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.560836044340652, "source": "政", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.7691330875378674, "source": "仁", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.9922766388520771, "source": "仁", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.279958711303858, "source": "